+{
+  "type": "enhancement",
+  "category": "``s3``",
+  "description": "Deprecate the S3 ``Expires`` output member in favor of the new ``ExpiresString`` member, which contains the raw header value. A malformed ``Expires`` header no longer raises an error; the ``Expires`` member is omitted and a warning is logged."
+}
